        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT allows interaction with computers in a more natural way, focusing on Internet Browsing, File System Browsing, and interaction with network devices.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT aims to provide an environment for users to create and share their own plugins.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT is not monetary oriented and is focused on the open-source community.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to inspire others to create similar software packages.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to finish the current stage by late April and push the Alpha version to friends and contributors.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Alpha release, the team plans to focus on cosmetic work, including photo realistic 3D objects, and fixing bugs.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team expects to complete basic plugins, with 60% already done, after the Alpha release.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The beta version of ThaBIT could be expected by the end of summer, possibly mid-summer.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project team decided to set a lower funding goal for the Kickstarter campaign.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Alpha release of the ThaBIT project has been published.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "60% of the basic plugins for the ThaBIT project are already completed.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project is a Kickstarter campaign.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8763
      }
    },
    {
