        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT is working on networking features, including file sharing among network computers (LAN/WAN) and P2P networking.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT is exploring the possibility of a server implementation and natural movement through remote worlds.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT aims to provide an environment for users to create and share their own plugins.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT will not have any central authority or mandatory repository for plugins.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project emphasizes support for networking, including file sharing among network computers and P2P networking.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project team decided to set a lower funding goal for the Kickstarter campaign.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team prefers to finish the base framework before releasing Alpha 1 and polishing in Beta 1.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "tech_route",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team believes that announcing the GitHub repository early will dilute the project and delay the final solution.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team hopes to cover some expenses, including programmers, equipment, and utilities, with the Kickstarter funds.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "funding_source",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to obtain photorealistic 3D models from 3D artists.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "tech_route",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
