        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT allows users to interact with their computer in a more natural way.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT organizes the environment in units known as 'Worlds', which are highly configurable.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Each World in ThaBIT can represent multiple local environments or network devices.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Plugins can be easily created for ThaBIT, and full how-to documentation will be provided along with the source code.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Plugins for ThaBIT can include a Browser, Picture viewer, Video Player, or File manager.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "3D Objects in ThaBIT can be any 3D Studio Max object or a group of objects, with support for many other objects on the way.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ThaBIT project was inspired by the Kinetisploit project and others.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
