        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ThaBIT project was unsuccessful in reaching its funding goal.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT got its name from Upsilon Orionis, a star in the constellation Orion.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The traditional name of Upsilon Orionis is Thabit, which means 'the imperturbable one' in Arabic.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Since 1943, the spectrum of Upsilon Orionis has served as one of the stable anchor points for classifying other stars.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT is a versatile 3D environment written in C++ that serves as a user interface wrapper.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT is designed to run on ARM, Android, and iOS systems without any problems.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT aims to provide an environment for users to create and share their own plugins.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Kickstarter campaign for ThaBIT is time-driven.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ThaBIT is currently 60% done, with 80% of the backend finished and only 40% of the front end completed.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to finish the current stage by late April and push the Alpha version to friends and contributors.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The beta version of ThaBIT could be expected by the end of summer, possibly mid-summer.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Kickstarter campaign is driven by the need for community support to finish the project sooner.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project team decided to set a lower funding goal for the Kickstarter campaign.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team prefers to finish the base framework before releasing Alpha 1 and polishing in Beta 1.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "tech_route",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team hopes to cover some expenses, including programmers, equipment, and utilities, with the Kickstarter funds.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "funding_source",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The beta version of the ThaBIT project is expected by the end of summer, possibly mid-summer.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ThaBIT project does not face the same risks and challenges as other projects because it is not a product or service.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The main obstacle anticipated for the ThaBIT project is a lack of time, which could delay the project release date.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ThaBIT project team members will be able to dedicate their full time to finishing the project after the Kickstarter campaign.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ThaBIT project can obtain photorealistic 3D models from 3D artists instead of spending two months creating them.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team members will be able to dedicate their full time to finishing the project after the campaign.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8763
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to obtain photorealistic 3D models from 3D artists.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "tech_route",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt21__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8763
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project has 10 days left and is 107% funded.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
